<title>USA: Vernon County, Wis., won by Banc One Capital.</title>
<headline>Vernon County, Wis., won by Banc One Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banc One Capital Corp said it won $1.650 million of Vernon County, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, with a true intere st cost of 4.869 percent.</p>
</text>
